# Snapshots taken before editing a deployment's .env. They hold the same
# credentials as .env itself, so they must never be committable, and never
# show up as untracked files inviting `git add -A`. Keep them outside the
# repository (/opt/backups/env/ on the server); this is the backstop.
.env.bak*
.env.*.bak

